    <div class="rv-q"><h3>Who is the best roofing contractor in Plano, TX?</h3><p>For 2026, our top pick is Helsley Roofing Company, a Plano-based, GAF-certified contractor with more than 300 verified five-star reviews. Plano Roofing Company and Viking Roofing LLC are also strong, independently verifiable options.</p></div>
    <div class="rv-q"><h3>Why does Plano see so much roof-replacement demand at once?</h3><p>Many of Plano's older, tree-shaded neighborhoods were built and landscaped in the same era, so their composition-shingle roofs are reaching the end of a typical 20-25-year lifespan around the same time, and spring hail across Collin County accelerates that timeline for houses it hits directly.</p></div>
    <div class="rv-q"><h3>How much does a roof replacement cost in Plano?</h3><p>Most homeowners pay $9,500–$18,000 for a full asphalt-shingle replacement, or roughly $4.75–$7.50 per square foot installed. Class 4 impact-resistant shingles, which some insurers discount, run $12,000–$18,000.</p></div>
